        "TileImage": "$($repository 90cc6741-5c98-45bb-8acc-a9f3baf8c00d).Image",
        "Description": "Kronstadt CEO, Robert Knox has some pests infesting his Bayside Headquarters. These media reporters have been trying to expose Kronstadt for  hiding their involvment in the infamous Tungan Valley Massacre. The first one is Glenn Henson, a tech reporter looking to become a famous investigative reporter, excitedly leading this investigation. Then, Martin Rains, her partner, who is reluctantly helping her but helping her nonetheless. Remember, you are on Kronstadt contract, so no chaos.",
